amend! feat(steps): StepRail measures itself; a cut label reveals on hover

feat(steps): StepRail min width keeps every meta; a cut label reveals

`StepRail: Measure` gains `min_width`: the narrowest the rail keeps
every step's state word or duration (`shown_meta`), letting labels cut.
A cut label now goes through `reveal::fit`: it reveals its full text on
hover, and on the peek line for the focused step, instead of a plain
truncate. Tests: every label and meta whole at the measured width,
every meta at the min width; a cut label's hover shows it whole (fails
with the plain truncate).

